WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.649
CompTIA Network Plus, domain 2, Network implementation, which is 20 percent of the exam.

00:00:07.649 --> 00:00:10.152
This lesson covers objective 2 point 4.

00:00:10.152 --> 00:00:13.490
Explain important factors of physical installations.

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:18.690
Start with the number every installer memorizes: the twisted pair distance limit.

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:23.619
Twisted pair Ethernet has a hard distance limit.

00:00:23.619 --> 00:00:24.860
Here is how it adds up.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.771
Ninety meters of permanent link, the run from the wall jack to the patch panel.

00:00:29.771 --> 00:00:33.300
Plus up to ten meters of patch cords in total, for both ends.

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:36.437
Together that's a one hundred meter channel.

00:00:36.437 --> 00:00:37.394
Not fifty-five.

00:00:37.394 --> 00:00:38.160
One hundred.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:46.825
The channel limit for twisted pair Ethernet is one hundred meters: ninety of permanent link, plus the patch cords.

00:00:46.825 --> 00:00:48.600
That's objective two point four.
